      "message": "You might want to add a comment just before here explaining that mListenerMap and mExecutorMap (and maybe mServiceMap too??) contain a mixture of callbacks passed in by the user, which run on the executor passed in by the user, and delegating listeners, which run inline on the handler thread and then post to executor passed in by the user.",
